<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 21.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 21.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.61 percent, up from 21.50 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Centre said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	7,704.06 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.61 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.8877 pct</p>
</text>
